<sceneDescriptionText>
You're attending a cooking class, hoping to improve your skills. You and the other students are in a fairly large white room that has several stations big enough for two people to stand at comfortably. Each station is a waist-high, wooden cabinet containing pots, pans, and other such cooking gadgets. The stations all have black-tiled tops with portable heating devices resting on top. Various tools and utensils required for cooking hang from hooks connected to cabinets above the stations. 
</sceneDescriptionText>

<cookeryClassIntroText>
##
