	#if($maleNpc.isNpcAttractionAttracted() && $maleNpc.hasTrait("SLEAZY"))#set($possiblePartner=true)
	#elseif($maleNpc.partner || $maleNpc.friend)#set($possiblePartner=true)
	#elseif(!$maleNpc.NpcLikingNeutral && ($maleNpc.behaviour == "MEAN" || $maleNpc.behaviour == "COLD"))#set($possiblePartner=false)
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50 && $maleNpc.behaviour != "NICE" && $maleNpc.behaviour != "ROM")#set($possiblePartner=false)
	#{else}#set($possiblePartner=true)
	#end
#end
##
##
#set($forgotFood = $scene.randomNumber(10)<2 && $w.hasTrait("FORGETFUL"))##
#if(!$gd.hasGameFlag("COMPLETED_COOKING_INTRO"))
You stop to pick up your mail on the way in from work and notice an eye-catching flyer advertising a cooking class. Deciding it would be advantageous to improve your cooking skills-not just for your own benefit, but for your##
	#if ($w.isMum()) child##
	#elseif ($w.isKnownPregnant()) future child##
	#elseif ($w.isMarried() && $scene.hasFlag("partnerIsMale")) husband##
	#elseif ($w.isMarried()) wife## Not possible in 0.7.11, but maybe in the future?
	#elseif (!$w.isSingle()&& $scene.hasFlag("partnerIsMale")) boyfriend##
	#elseif (!$w.isSingle()) girlfriend##
	#else future partner##
	#end##
 as well, you make a note in your phone reminding yourself to go.

You show up for the class at the date and time displayed on the advert, unsure of exactly what it entails, but ready to learn nonetheless. 
You remember the flyer mentioning a required fee which you pay before taking time to look around the room while waiting for everyone else to show up. You immediately notice that there are a number of stations set up around the room, each with various heating devices, utensils, and anything else you might need to prepare a meal. You also notice that there are no ingredients at any of the stations though, leading you to believe that no actual cooking will be done today.

As more people arrive, you notice that there's going to be a pretty even split in the class between men and women. You didn't really have any preconceived ideas about the demographics of the class, so you don't find this particularly shocking or anything. At the very least, you'll have a pretty good selection of people to talk to, should that be part of the class.
Eventually the instructor, a $cookingInstructor.getRace() man with #if($cookingInstructor.hasHair)$cookingInstructor.getHairColour() hair and#end $cookingInstructor.getEyeColour() eyes, introduces himself as $cookingInstructor.getName() and confirms your suspicions about the lack of cooking in today's session. Instead, today will be spent getting to know each other, since the cooking will be done with partners. 
He then encourages each of you to introduce yourselves, sharing a bit about your cooking expertise and your reasons for wanting to improve your skills. 

People begin answering and you don't necessarily pay attention to all of them, but you try to take note of a few students who caught your eye. When it gets to you, you start with your reasons for taking the class. You say that you want to improve for your##
	#if ($w.isMum()) child##
	#elseif ($w.isKnownPregnant()) future child##
	#elseif ($w.isMarried() && $scene.hasFlag("partnerIsMale")) husband##
	#elseif ($w.isMarried()) wife## Not possible in 0.7.11, but maybe in the future?
	#elseif (!$w.isSingle()&& $scene.hasFlag("partnerIsMale")) boyfriend##
	#elseif (!$w.isSingle()) girlfriend##
	#else future partner##
	#end##
 before going into more detail on your cooking experience.
#if($w.hasTrait("BABY_CRAZY"))
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)You tell everyone that you don't really have much cooking experience. You do, however, have an ever present need to have a bun in your oven. You pause, expecting some laughs, but you're met with puzzled looks instead. Embarrassed, you continue, telling the class that you aren't completely useless in the kitchen, but you don't really have the experience to cook professionally.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50)You start with saying that you have a moderate amount of cooking experience, but more importantly than that, you have a strong desire to always have a bun in your oven. You had hoped that your joke would elicit some laughter, but you're instead met with puzzled looks and confused silence. Embarrassed, you clear your throat and continue. You state that you can find your way around a kitchen well enough, but you wouldn't feel comfortable cooking in any professional capacity.##
	#{else}You let everyone know that you're actually very experienced when it comes to food, but your eternal need to have a bun in your oven exceeds even that. You hoped that your opening comment would get some laughs, but you're instead met with bewilderment and confusion. Face flush with embarrassment, you muscle through and continue discussing your expertise. You can easily handle cooking professionally, but you know you still have room to improve and you hope this class can help you accomplish that.##
	#end##
#elseif($w.hasTrait("SHY"))
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)Everyone's eyes on you make you nervous, so you stare at the floor as you mumble your answer. You tell them that you don't have much experience, but you're not completely useless in the kitchen. $cookingInstructor.getName() stops you partway through to encourage you to speak up, but it doesn't work and instead just makes you self-consciously rush through the rest of your answer.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50)You're overcome with embarrassment at having so many people looking at you, so your eyes drop to the floor. You start mumbling about how you have some experience cooking, but you wouldn't feel comfortable doing it at a professional level. $cookingInstructor.getName() cuts you off to tell you that you're voice is too low for anyone to understand you. Rather than speaking louder, you quickly mumble an apology and then stop talking so someone else can take a turn.##
	#{else}Your face turns red with embarrassment as everyone looks to you for your answers. Unable to handle the stares, you drop your gaze to the floor before mumbling your answer. You say that you actually have a fair bit of cooking experience and you can easily navigate a kitchen. You can definitely cook at a professional level, but you'd still like to be better. You glance up for a moment and know by the looks on everyone's faces that no one understood a word you said, which leaves you even more flush with embarrassment. You mutter an apology and then stop talking so someone else can take a turn.##
	#end##
#elseif($w.hasTrait("OUTGOING"))
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)Delighted to have everyone's attention, you begin regaling them all with your experience. Unfortunately, you don't really have that much experience, but that's not going to stop you from enjoying the attention. In reality, you can cook a bit and aren't completely helpless in the kitchen, but no one is going to expect a banquet or anything from you. But, caught up in the attention, you embellish your experience a little bit, leading everyone to believe you're better than you actually are.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50)Ecstatic to be the center of attention, you start telling everyone about your experience. You have a moderate amount of experience, but you can't help but play it up a bit. You're comfortable enough in the kitchen, but you couldn't cook professionally. Based on your telling, however, you sound like an amazing chef who has no business attending a generalized cooking class.##
	#{else}Loving the attention you're being given, you start telling everyone about your cooking experience. You're very experienced, so you don't have to embellish much to make it interesting. You can cook at a professional level, but you know you could do even better and you hope this class can help with that.##
	#end##
#elseif($w.hasTrait("LOW_SELF_ESTEEM"))
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)You don't think you're worth listening to since you're so worthless, but the instructor looks at you expectantly, so you start talking about your experience with cooking. You tell everyone that you don't have much, but you aren't completely useless in the kitchen. No one would trust you to prepare a banquet for them, but there's little risk of you burning down a building while trying to boil water.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50)Knowing how worthless you are, you try to avoid answering since no one is going to care anyway. After more insistence by $cookingInstructor.getName(), you give in and start talking about your experience. You're not a novice, but you still have considerable room for improvement. You can find your way around a kitchen without too much trouble, but you wouldn't dream of trying to cook on a professional level.##
	#{else}You know you aren't worth listening to and no one will care what you have to say, so you try to get out of talking. However, after some insistence by $cookingInstructor.getName(), you cave and start talking. You mention that you have a decent amount of cooking experience and would be comfortable cooking at a professional level. You still feel that you have room to improve though, and you're hoping this class can help with that.##
	#end##
#else
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)You don't really have much experience. You've done some minor amounts of cooking here and there, but never anything substantial enough to consider actual experience. You can make yourself a grilled cheese sandwich if you have to, but that's not going to win you any awards or anything.##
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50)You have a fair bit of experience. You're nowhere near professional level, but you can certainly throw a dish or two together in a pinch. You don't think you'll enter any contests any time soon, but you're not exactly incompetent.##
	#{else}You have some experience cooking and you're fairly comfortable finding your way around a kitchen. However, despite your competence, you still have plenty of room to improve. You'd love to get your cooking to professional level, if you can.##
	#end##
#end

Once everyone has had a turn, the instructor steps in to say that, since much of the class work is going to be handled in pairs, it's extremely beneficial to ensure that everyone has a good sense of each other's current experience level so that you can make an informed decision when choosing a partner.

After all of the introductions are out of the way, he hands each of you a different simple recipe that he wants each of you to prepare for the next class and then he sends you on your way, with the knowledge that next time you will pick a partner from the people you met today.
#else
A couple of hours before this week's cooking class is to begin, you fish out the recipe that you were handed at the end of your previous class and start gathering the called for ingredients and cooking supplies. It's intended to be a simple recipe for beginners, so it doesn't take much time or effort.

	#if ($forgotFood)Despite how easy this task should be, you get distracted partway through, only to have your smoke alarm to inform you of your mistake a little while later. As much as it shames you to admit, it looks like you'll be showing up empty handed this week. You briefly consider buying something to bring, but the thought doesn't last long as you're sure the instructor will know the difference between a home-made and a store-bought dish, especially since anything you buy would deviate from your recipe in some way.##
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20)You manage to produce the assigned food fairly easily, even if you also make a bit of a mess in the process. You didn't take very long either, so you fortunately still have enough time to clean up your mess, shower, and change clothes in preparation for class.##
	#{else}You can practically make a dish this simple in your sleep at this point, so you have more than enough time after you finish to clean up any messes and then relax a bit before class.##
	#end##
	#if (!$forgotFood) $w.skillIncrease("COOKING", 1)
	#end##
#end
</cookeryClassIntroText>

<goHomeIntroText>## Description of heading back home.
Recipe in hand, you figure it's time to head home for the night. You set a reminder for yourself to get the ingredients you need before the next class and then head out the door.
</goHomeIntroText>

<talkInstructorIntroText>## Description of talking to the instructor.
You feel like you know quite a bit about your classmates now after all of the introductions, but you still don't know much about the person leading it. You figure it couldn't hurt to change that, so you walk up to $cookingInstructor.getName() and tell him you want to get to know him better.
</talkInstructorIntroText>

<talkInstructorFriendlyText>## Friendly towards the instructor.
You strike up a friendly conversation with him, engaging in a bit of small talk.##
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20) You can't really talk about his field of expertise, as you still don't know much about cooking, but there are still plenty of other things to discuss. You try talking about the weather, current events, and anything else you can think of until eventually, he really starts engaging with the conversation. The two of you talk for quite a while and you feel that you're really getting to know each other.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50) You try to engage him in his field of expertise, but you're not quite as knowledgeable as you'd like to be, so you quickly move on to another topic. Despite your initial blunder, you try cycling through several more topics until you eventually find one that you are both interested in and can talk about comfortably. The two of you continue talking for a while and you feel that you're developing a genuine connection.##
	#else Being extremely familiar with his field of expertise, you engage him on the topic of cooking for quite a while. He seems genuinely surprised by how knowledgeable you are on the subject and even goes so far as to ask if you should really be taking this class. You insist that he still has more to teach you and he eventually agrees. You're conversation continues for quite a while before eventually winding down.##
	#end##
</talkInstructorFriendlyText>

<talkInstructorFriendlyEndText>
Eventually you decide it's time to head home, so you bring the conversation to a close and tell $cookingInstructor.getName() you'll see him next time. You affirm that you have the recipe you were handed earlier and then set a reminder for yourself to get the ingredients you need before the next class. You bid $cookingInstructor.getName() good night one last time and then head out the door.
</talkInstructorFriendlyEndText>


<talkInstructorFlirtyText>## Flirty towards the instructor.
You openly flirt with $cookingInstructor.getName(), giving many hints towards your intentions with him. Barely a sentence goes by where you don't playfully giggle at something he said or end a statement by putting a hand on his shoulder encouragingly. He##
	#if ($cookingInstructor.isNpcAttractionOk()) flirts back, making it clear he's interested in you. The two of you continue to engage in flirtatious banter for a bit.##
	#else dismisses your flirting, clearly disinterested in your advances. He tells you he doesn't get involved in romantic entanglements with his students. Embarrassed by his dismissal of you, you decide you should probably call it a night.##
	#end##
</talkInstructorFlirtyText>

<talkInstructorFlirtyExhangeNumbersText>
The two of you exchange phone numbers so you can meet up later.
</talkInstructorFlirtyExhangeNumbersText>

<talkInstructorFlirtyInviteHomeText>
You ask $cookingInstructor.getName() if he wants to go back to your place and he eagerly takes you up on your offer and you head out together. You make sure that you still have the recipe you were given earlier and put a note for yourself in your phone so you don't forget to pick up the required ingredients before the next class. You then take $cookingInstructor.getName() by the hand and walk out the door.
</talkInstructorFlirtyInviteHomeText>

<talkInstructorFlirtyInviteHomeDeclinedText>
$cookingInstructor.getName() declines your offer, stating he'd rather get to know you better first. With his dismissal of your request, you feel it's best to call it a night. Making sure you have the recipe you were assigned earlier, you make yourself a reminder to get the ingredients you need before the next class and then head out.
</talkInstructorFlirtyInviteHomeDeclinedText>

<talkInstructorFlirtyEndText>
#if ($cookingInstructor.isNpcAttractionOk()) Deciding you've had enough conversation for one night, you bid him farewell and leave, letting him know you'll see him next time. You double check that you still have the recipe you were given earlier and then leave the classroom, making sure to put a reminder in your phone to pick up everything you need before the next class.##
