<talkInstructorRudeText>## Rude towards the instructor.
He may be your instructor, but that's not going to stop you from putting him in his place. You tell him exactly what you think of him with no regard to his feelings, sparing no details. You make it clear that if you're going to take his class, you should be his priority and that no one else matters. ##
