	#else Your intimidation attempt backfires horribly and after such a rude display, $cookingInstructor.getName() tells you that you aren't welcome back to class. You half-heartedly apologize and that seems to satisfy him somewhat. He tells you that you can come back next time, with the caveat that one more outburst like that would spell the end of your participation in the class. You agree, partly because you figure there'll probably be some way to get back on his good side later, so you aren't too worried about him holding any of this against you. You make sure you have the recipe you were handed earlier and set a reminder for yourself to get the ingredients you need before the next class.##
	#end##
</talkInstructorRudeText>

