	You finish your cooking work, although you haven't learnt as well as you might have this lesson. Indeed, the dish you end up with##
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20) is a total mess.
	#elseif($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 50) isn't something you'd be proud of serving up to a guest at home.
	#else only ends up palatable due to your already-impressive skills in the kitchen.
	#end##
#else
	You finish cooking with $activeMaleNpc.name, ending up with##
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20) a dish that looks vaguely like the picture that accompanies the recipe.
