<maleShowOffText>## Show off to male
You stand in front of $activeMaleNpc.getName() and pretend to work with the ingredients and utensils in front of you, pretending to stir nothing. He is too busy staring at your body to even notice you aren't really doing anything. You interrupt your pantomime occasionally to look back and bite your lip as you shake your ass seductively. Your display leaves $activeMaleNpc.getName() unable to keep his hands to himself and you soon give up entirely on your charade.
