Embarrassed, you pull away from $activeMaleNpc.getName() and go back to work, which helps you prevent a small food related disaster you'd been too pre-occupied to notice. $activeMaleNpc.getName() isn't thrilled about having to stop, but he seems to decide he'd rather not get on the instructor's bad side.
</maleShowOffMaleLeadsBackToWorkText>

