</maleShowOffPlayerLeadsText>

<maleShowOffPlayerLeadsBackToWorkText>
Slightly flustered, you pull away from $activeMaleNpc.getName() and go back to work just in time to thwart a mini disaster that could easily have gotten out of hand. $activeMaleNpc.getName() is nonplussed about the sudden interruption of his fun, but he does what he has to in order to stay on the instructor's good side. 
</maleShowOffPlayerLeadsBackToWorkText>

<maleShowOffPlayerLeadsKeepGoingText>
You aren't bothered by what the instructor wants, so you and $activeMaleNpc.getName() continue exploring each other's mouths at the expense of the dish that's slowly cooking behind you. The dish is forgotten in your passion and the pot in front of you starts boiling over, making an awful mess very quickly. The instructor, practicing proper kitchen safety, quickly gets the situation under control. He then firmly tells the two of you that your cooking privileges for the week have been revoked. 
</maleShowOffPlayerLeadsKeepGoingText>

