<maleSwitchPartnersSuckUpText>
You're not happy you're stuck with this guy for the remainder of the lesson, but you're here to learn about cooking, so that's what you're going to do. Your partner however, feeling called out, refuses to help. Despite this, the end result is##
	#if ($w.getSkill("COOKING") < 20) a decently competent dish, but far from perfect.
