<femaleWatchText>
Deciding observation is important, you mostly just stand back and watch your partner do the work. She##
#if ($fem.getCharType()=="INNOCENT") tries to get you involved by offering things for you to do.##
#else seems frustrated by your lack of help, but continues working.##
#end##
</femaleWatchText>

<femaleWatchHelpText>
Sensing her frustration, you realize it's best to help out. While observation is important, so is hands on work, so you give her a hand. As you work, the two of you start idling chatting with each other about trivial things: guys in the class, your hobbies, work-whatever you can think of to pass the time. Eventually, the two of you finish the recipe and the instructor comes around to assess your work. After a mixture of critique and praise, the instructor gives you both new recipes to prepare for next time and dismisses you.
</femaleWatchHelpText>

<femaleWatchContinueWatchingText>
Despite her frustrations, you decide to just keep watching. She seems to know what she's doing and you'll probably learn better by watching her. If she really wanted help, she'd ask. Before too long, she's finished and the instructor comes around to see the final product. He gives some critique on ways for your partner to improve. He then hands you both recipes to bring in for next time and then sends you on your way. $fem.getName(), still frustrated by your lack of help, leaves without another word to you.
</femaleWatchContinueWatchingText>

<femaleWatchHelpInnocentText>
You accept her offer of things for you to do. You grab the spoon she's handing you and start stirring. As you work, the two of you start chatting about inconsequential things: guys in the class, the weather, your hobbies, etc. Eventually the two of you finish and the instructor comes around to give feedback. You take notes on his critique and he gives the two of you recipes to bring in for next time.
</femaleWatchHelpInnocentText>

<femaleWatchContinueWatchingInnocentText>
You tell her you're just here to observe, so she should keep working. Stunned by your refusal to work, she just stares blankly at you for a bit. Eventually, however, she gets herself together and keeps working. Once she's finished, the instructor comes around and critiques her work. He gives her a few pointers and then hands you both recipes to prepare for the next class. Your partner then leaves without a word to you, likely because you refused to help her. Oh well. It's no big loss for you.
</femaleWatchContinueWatchingInnocentText>

<femaleWatchGoodbyeText>
You tell $fem.getName() that you had fun and you hope to see her again next class. You then leave and head home.
</femaleWatchGoodbyeText>

<femaleWatchLeaveText>
You don't have anything to say to your partner, so you just leave without a second glance.
</femaleWatchLeaveText>

<femaleWatchExitText>
There's no reason for you to stay any longer, so after gathering your things and making sure you still have next class's recipe, you head home.
</femaleWatchExitText>


